## /config

Manage the configuration

- Aliases: `cfg`
- Permission: `myplugin.command.config` (default `ALL`)

| Usage | Description | Permission |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `/config [options]` | Manage the configuration | `myplugin.command.config` (`ALL`) |
| `/config [options] <key>` | Show a key | `myplugin.command.config.key` (`OP`) |

Arguments:

| Argument | Type | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `key` | `CommonStringArgument` |  |

Options:

| Option | Value | Notes | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `-f`, `--force`, `--yes` |  |  | Skip confirmation |
| `-t`, `--tag` | `<tag>` | required, up to 3 times | Tag to add |

## /config <key> set

Set a key

- Permission: `myplugin.command.config.set` (default `OP`)

| Usage | Description | Permission |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `/config <key> set [value]` |  | `myplugin.command.config.set.value` (`OP`) |

Arguments:

| Argument | Type | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `value` | `IntArg` | optional |

## /config reload

Reload the configuration

- Permission: `myplugin.admin` (default `NONE`)

| Usage | Description | Permission |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `/config reload` | Reload the configuration | `myplugin.admin` (`NONE`) |

## /msg

- Permission: `myplugin.command.msg` (default `OP`)

| Usage | Description | Permission |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `/msg <target> <words...>` | Send a message | `myplugin.command.msg.target.words` (`OP`) |

Arguments:

| Argument | Type | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `target` | `CommonStringArgument` |  |
| `words` | `WordArg` | variadic, up to 4 |

## /game

- Permission: `myplugin.command.game` (default `OP`)

`/game` shows the help of its subcommands.

## /game start

- Permission: `myplugin.command.game.start` (default `OP`)

| Usage | Description | Permission |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `/game start` |  | `myplugin.command.game.start` (`OP`) |
